# Wave T40 (Clover kit): cloverfloor — Clover Town's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). CLOVER-FLECKED PACKED EARTH: a warm pale-earth lane (path family base #cbb28a, measured) strewn with bold three-lobe clover marks in two greens and tiny white blossom dots. Structurally a loose organic scatter on EARTH — unlike Wildflower's petalfloor (petal flecks on cream gravel: different base, different motif) and Lilac's bronze lattice grid. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T40-CLOVER-PLAN.md §5.)
